1
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:07,080
[Fragments of Truth]

2
00:01:07,080 --> 00:01:08,640
[Episode 4]

3
00:01:24,510 --> 00:01:24,840
Hello?

4
00:01:25,790 --> 00:01:26,870
Are you safe right now?

5
00:01:27,310 --> 00:01:28,400
I don't know.

6
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:30,040
I'm too scared to even go home.

7
00:01:31,480 --> 00:01:33,510
Any idea who it could be?

8
00:01:34,400 --> 00:01:35,840
I don't know.

9
00:01:36,040 --> 00:01:37,350
I've done so much for you people.

10
00:01:37,430 --> 00:01:39,510
How should I know which one is after me?

11
00:01:39,790 --> 00:01:41,350
Did you arrange what I asked you to?

12
00:01:42,430 --> 00:01:43,760
Uncle Zhe doesn't want to get involved.

13
00:01:44,430 --> 00:01:45,430
You're on your own.

14
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:48,230
If you won't help me, who will?

15
00:01:48,230 --> 00:01:50,070
Who else am I supposed to turn to?

16
00:01:50,070 --> 00:01:51,760
If I don't get help now, how am I...

17
00:01:52,200 --> 00:01:53,790
Hello?

18
00:02:00,920 --> 00:02:01,790
Uncle He is here.

19
00:02:02,150 --> 00:02:02,840
As for that shop...

20
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:05,430
Almost everyone connected to it is gone.

21
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:08,190
Only Yu Hongfei remains.

22
00:02:09,080 --> 00:02:10,080
The records show

23
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:12,360
he left the city soon after his release.

24
00:02:12,360 --> 00:02:14,240
His older brother runs the shop now.

25
00:02:15,470 --> 00:02:16,470
Let's go take a look.

26
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:16,960
Okay.

27
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:42,840
Who is it?

28
00:02:51,080 --> 00:02:51,560
Police.

29
00:03:00,310 --> 00:03:01,000
You two officers

30
00:03:01,680 --> 00:03:04,150
have wasted your trip.

31
00:03:04,630 --> 00:03:05,240
Ever since my brother

32
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:06,910
left to work in Haixi Province,

33
00:03:08,520 --> 00:03:09,870
he's barely contacted the family.

34
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:13,190
His old number's disconnected too.

35
00:03:14,470 --> 00:03:15,870
As for how he's doing,

36
00:03:16,190 --> 00:03:17,470
I don't really know.

37
00:03:18,470 --> 00:03:19,080
Have some water.

38
00:03:19,080 --> 00:03:19,680
Please, drink up.

39
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:22,430
You're Yu Hongyuan, right?

40
00:03:22,430 --> 00:03:23,360
Yes, Yu Hongyuan.

41
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:24,840
My younger brother is Yu Hongfei.

42
00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:26,910
Our names together mean 'fly far away.'

43
00:03:28,150 --> 00:03:29,000
Yu Hongfei.

44
00:03:29,590 --> 00:03:30,150
Don't say it.

45
00:03:30,870 --> 00:03:31,240
They really do look alike.

46
00:03:32,840 --> 00:03:33,430
Mm.

47
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:36,430
We're brothers, after all.

48
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:37,080
Right.

49
00:03:38,030 --> 00:03:39,080
Let me show you two photos.

50
00:03:40,150 --> 00:03:40,840
This man

51
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:43,800
and this man were
your brother's friends.

52
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:44,800
Do you know them?

53
00:03:48,360 --> 00:03:49,240
They don't look familiar.

54
00:03:49,910 --> 00:03:51,280
I didn't have much contact with them.

55
00:03:53,590 --> 00:03:56,680
Honestly, my brother and I
argue whenever we meet.

56
00:03:57,560 --> 00:04:00,470
Ever since he went to prison,

57
00:04:01,030 --> 00:04:02,470
we've barely stayed in touch.

58
00:04:03,840 --> 00:04:05,240
I know a little about your family.

59
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:08,800
Five years ago,
after your brother went to prison,

60
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:10,000
your mother fell ill.

61
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:11,430
She died without seeing him again.

62
00:04:11,840 --> 00:04:14,360
You broke his arm over that, right?

63
00:04:15,630 --> 00:04:18,000
That's all in the past.

64
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:21,360
Which arm was it?

65
00:04:22,040 --> 00:04:22,510
The right arm.

66
00:04:27,680 --> 00:04:28,070
The right arm.

67
00:04:29,680 --> 00:04:30,270
Right?

68
00:04:30,950 --> 00:04:32,430
It's been so many years,
I don't remember clearly.

69
00:04:34,270 --> 00:04:35,630
Those two men I just mentioned...

70
00:04:36,070 --> 00:04:36,720
They're dead.

71
00:04:39,720 --> 00:04:42,040
My brother wasn't involved, right?

72
00:04:42,430 --> 00:04:43,510
He's in Haixi.

73
00:04:43,750 --> 00:04:45,630
He must've cut ties with them long ago.

74
00:04:46,870 --> 00:04:47,430
I know.

75
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:49,830
Just routine questions.
Don't be nervous.

76
00:04:51,160 --> 00:04:52,240
If you remember anything,

77
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:53,560
contact us anytime.

78
00:04:53,720 --> 00:04:54,830
Oh, sure, sure.

79
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:55,070
Okay.

80
00:04:55,190 --> 00:04:55,360
Hey!

81
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:57,390
Oh, right.

82
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:59,070
I checked the records
from five years ago.

83
00:04:59,070 --> 00:05:00,270
Your home was burglarized.

84
00:05:00,390 --> 00:05:01,000
Anything missing?

85
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:02,480
Nothing important.

86
00:05:02,870 --> 00:05:03,800
Honestly, none of it mattered.

87
00:05:13,600 --> 00:05:14,070
You made that up.

88
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:16,830
I never filed any report, did I?

89
00:05:17,680 --> 00:05:18,240
Yeah.

90
00:05:18,870 --> 00:05:21,190
If I hadn't, would you have admitted
you're Yu Hongfei?

91
00:05:22,750 --> 00:05:23,160
Let's go.

92
00:05:24,720 --> 00:05:26,870
[Interview Room (1)]

93
00:05:26,870 --> 00:05:27,430
Start talking.

94
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:29,040
Why pose as your brother?

95
00:05:29,830 --> 00:05:30,920
You know how it is.

96
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:32,560
The thing is,

97
00:05:32,720 --> 00:05:34,070
once you've done time,

98
00:05:34,430 --> 00:05:35,190
nothing

99
00:05:35,680 --> 00:05:36,950
comes easy.

100
00:05:37,830 --> 00:05:39,600
No one wants to hire you.

101
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:43,630
My bank account and phone number

102
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:46,510
were both registered
using my brother's ID.

103
00:05:47,430 --> 00:05:49,190
I never changed them
after all this time.

104
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:52,190
Who killed Zou Jun and Xu Haodong?

105
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:53,750
I don't know.

106
00:05:54,830 --> 00:05:56,360
Aside from my fake identity,

107
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:58,360
I haven't lied about anything else.

108
00:05:58,630 --> 00:06:00,720
I really stopped seeing them long ago.

109
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:02,360
Tell us how you all met

110
00:06:02,680 --> 00:06:03,480
and what you did together.

111
00:06:05,830 --> 00:06:06,800
Back then,

112
00:06:07,830 --> 00:06:09,480
we met when we were running the streets.

113
00:06:10,630 --> 00:06:14,390
You already know what we did.

114
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:17,920
I served the time I owed for it.

115
00:06:18,310 --> 00:06:18,630
Right?

116
00:06:18,630 --> 00:06:19,720
Don't dodge the question.

117
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:22,920
Answer what you're asked.

118
00:06:23,510 --> 00:06:24,040
Come on...

119
00:06:24,510 --> 00:06:26,630
I've... I've told you everything I know.

120
00:06:26,630 --> 00:06:28,040
I really have nothing else to say.

121
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:33,480
Look.

122
00:06:35,920 --> 00:06:36,630
This woman...

123
00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:38,070
Know her?

124
00:07:13,750 --> 00:07:14,270
Her name was...

125
00:07:15,430 --> 00:07:16,600
Her name was Xiao Ting.

126
00:07:17,600 --> 00:07:21,600
Seven years ago, she came
from suburban Sanjiang Town

127
00:07:22,310 --> 00:07:23,720
with Zou Jun to Night Flight.

128
00:07:24,120 --> 00:07:24,800
What was she lured into?

129
00:07:28,390 --> 00:07:29,190
Working as a sex worker.

130
00:07:30,920 --> 00:07:33,120
Xu Haodong was the manager at the time.

131
00:07:34,510 --> 00:07:35,430
I was only a floor supervisor.

132
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:42,600
Later... Later,
Xiao Ting took her own life.

133
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:45,920
Xu Haodong covered it up.

134
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:49,480
Anything else?

135
00:07:52,950 --> 00:07:53,830
No.

136
00:07:54,750 --> 00:07:55,950
That's all I know.

137
00:07:58,720 --> 00:08:01,310
Are you sure
the person in that image is Xiao Ting?

138
00:08:01,510 --> 00:08:02,560
I don't know.

139
00:08:02,630 --> 00:08:04,160
I really don't know.

140
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:07,560
She was dead at the time.

141
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:09,070
I saw her body myself.

142
00:08:09,920 --> 00:08:11,600
And she never appeared again.

143
00:08:13,510 --> 00:08:13,870
But...

144
00:08:16,240 --> 00:08:18,430
That face, that hairstyle, that build...

145
00:08:18,430 --> 00:08:19,920
and the flower in her hair...

146
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:21,190
Everything was exactly as before.

147
00:08:23,270 --> 00:08:24,240
Then why did she take her own life?

148
00:08:26,600 --> 00:08:27,720
I really don't know.

149
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:29,240
I don't know.

150
00:08:29,310 --> 00:08:30,750
I was just a floor supervisor.

151
00:08:30,920 --> 00:08:31,920
Please, I beg you.

152
00:08:31,920 --> 00:08:33,120
Let me go, okay?

153
00:08:33,320 --> 00:08:33,790
Please let me go.

154
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:34,910
How about this?

155
00:08:34,910 --> 00:08:35,750
Arrest me.

156
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:36,840
If you arrest me,

157
00:08:36,840 --> 00:08:37,910
I'll be safe, okay?

158
00:08:38,120 --> 00:08:39,360
Arrest me. Please.

159
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:40,750
I really don't know anything.

160
00:08:40,750 --> 00:08:42,510
I was just a floor supervisor.

161
00:08:47,080 --> 00:08:51,760
[Xiao Ting]

162
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:53,440
You let him go?

163
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:54,440
Yes.

164
00:08:54,910 --> 00:08:56,200
We couldn't get anything more from him.

165
00:08:56,320 --> 00:08:57,360
We had to follow procedure.

166
00:08:58,790 --> 00:09:00,320
It's been seven years, after all.

167
00:09:00,320 --> 00:09:01,390
The truth won't be easy to uncover.

168
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:01,960
Mm.

169
00:09:03,320 --> 00:09:04,480
At least we have a new lead.

170
00:09:05,670 --> 00:09:07,790
Have we checked all the victims
filmed at the guesthouse?

171
00:09:07,790 --> 00:09:09,150
Yes. We found them all.

172
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:11,510
They had no idea they were being filmed.

173
00:09:11,720 --> 00:09:14,200
Nothing suspicious so far.

174
00:09:14,510 --> 00:09:18,630
Zou Jun's ex-wife
and Jiang Li from the barbershop

175
00:09:18,790 --> 00:09:20,600
both check out so far.

176
00:09:22,390 --> 00:09:24,630
Although Yu Hongfei named a new suspect,

177
00:09:25,150 --> 00:09:27,240
it obviously isn't a vengeful ghost
like he claimed.

178
00:09:27,960 --> 00:09:28,270
So,

179
00:09:28,270 --> 00:09:30,600
we must have overlooked something.

180
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:36,480
There's a paradox here.

181
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:41,750
If Yu Hongfei was telling the truth,

182
00:09:42,120 --> 00:09:44,120
the suspect was Xiao Ting's double.

183
00:09:44,270 --> 00:09:45,270
Zou Jun and Xu Haodong

184
00:09:45,270 --> 00:09:48,440
had driven Xiao Ting to suicide.

185
00:09:48,910 --> 00:09:51,670
So they would have recognized her.

186
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:55,440
They wouldn't have taken her
to the guesthouse or into the car.

187
00:09:59,080 --> 00:10:00,750
Any word on Xiao Ting?

188
00:10:00,790 --> 00:10:01,440
We found her.

189
00:10:01,910 --> 00:10:03,360
She lived in Wuli Village,
Sanjiang Town.

190
00:10:03,440 --> 00:10:04,480
She was an only child.

191
00:10:04,790 --> 00:10:06,150
She was reported missing seven years ago

192
00:10:06,150 --> 00:10:07,000
and was never found.

193
00:10:07,790 --> 00:10:10,150
So Yu Hongfei's claim that she died

194
00:10:11,240 --> 00:10:12,360
is likely true.

195
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:14,600
I know Wuli Village.

196
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:17,150
Most of the villagers
left to work elsewhere.

197
00:10:17,390 --> 00:10:18,440
Hardly anyone remains.

198
00:10:19,150 --> 00:10:19,750
How about this?

199
00:10:19,750 --> 00:10:20,600
Let's go there

200
00:10:20,790 --> 00:10:22,240
and see what we can find.

201
00:10:22,910 --> 00:10:23,320
Okay.

202
00:10:23,750 --> 00:10:24,910
I'll go with my mentor.

203
00:10:25,080 --> 00:10:26,480
Keep working the other leads.

204
00:10:26,600 --> 00:10:28,240
See if you can find anything else.

205
00:10:28,600 --> 00:10:29,270
Okay.

206
00:10:51,120 --> 00:10:51,600
Pretty?

207
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:53,670
Brother Jun gave it to me.

208
00:10:55,670 --> 00:10:57,320
Are you really leaving here
with Zou Jun?

209
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:05,790
What about your parents
and your little brother?

210
00:11:08,200 --> 00:11:10,910
Brother Jun said
once we're established in the city,

211
00:11:11,750 --> 00:11:13,120
we'll bring them all over.

212
00:11:32,200 --> 00:11:32,600
Cheers.

213
00:11:34,600 --> 00:11:35,270
Brother Dong.

214
00:11:35,600 --> 00:11:36,240
Cheers.

215
00:11:36,750 --> 00:11:37,120
Mm.

216
00:11:44,150 --> 00:11:45,120
Your girlfriend is lovely.

217
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:49,750
Stick with me from now on,
and you won't lose out.

218
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:52,790
All right. Thanks, Brother Dong.

219
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:57,840
Zou Jun.

220
00:12:00,600 --> 00:12:02,790
Zou Jun! Zou Jun, come back!

221
00:12:04,200 --> 00:12:06,200
Zou Jun!

222
00:12:07,360 --> 00:12:10,630
Zou Jun!

223
00:12:15,600 --> 00:12:17,270
Zou Jun!

224
00:12:20,120 --> 00:12:22,150
Zou Jun, come back!

225
00:12:22,270 --> 00:12:24,360
Zou Jun, come back! Zou Jun!

226
00:12:27,480 --> 00:12:28,270
Zou Jun!

227
00:13:27,460 --> 00:13:29,520
♪I stand in a fire-tempered jungle♪

228
00:13:29,520 --> 00:13:31,470
♪Withered leaves fall
as my strength runs dry♪

229
00:13:31,470 --> 00:13:33,380
♪Dust swirls as I clench my fists♪

230
00:13:33,380 --> 00:13:35,190
♪I strategize, my faith my armor♪

231
00:13:35,190 --> 00:13:37,520
♪My defiance spills onto concrete♪

232
00:13:37,520 --> 00:13:39,950
♪Even thick fog can't hide
my clear gaze♪

233
00:13:43,090 --> 00:13:45,000
♪Let neon turn to thorns♪

234
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:46,900
♪Flying low as the stars shift and turn♪

235
00:13:46,900 --> 00:13:48,840
♪Escape the maze,
transcend the challenge♪

236
00:13:48,840 --> 00:13:50,970
♪The meter starts, breaking the silence♪

237
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:52,980
♪A beam cuts through
a crack in the wall♪

238
00:13:52,980 --> 00:13:55,140
♪This rhythm and noise
echo through the streets♪

239
00:13:58,730 --> 00:14:02,210
♪Don't be afraid. No one will answer♪

240
00:14:02,210 --> 00:14:05,580
♪Why is that child crying?♪

241
00:14:05,810 --> 00:14:08,280
♪The shrinking scar on my arm♪

242
00:14:08,280 --> 00:14:09,900
♪Means I've grown up♪

243
00:14:09,900 --> 00:14:13,050
♪You can trust me when I say that♪

244
00:14:13,050 --> 00:14:16,530
♪The wound still aches♪

245
00:14:16,940 --> 00:14:21,290
♪Like a biting winter♪

246
00:14:21,290 --> 00:14:24,560
♪But a spark still glows♪

